{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 璃子の卒業発表がありましたね。\n \n \n 私は卒業する日を迎えるまでブログには書かないつもりでした。\n まだ璃子は櫻坂46ですし。\n \n でも、先日、トークで自分の気持ちを書いてから想いが止まらなくなって、今このブログを書いています。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 欅に入ってから喜怒哀楽、全ての感情を一緒に感じました。\n \n ある日の車の中や、最初で最後になってしまった2人で撮影して頂いたグラビア、1番最初の頃まだ私が福岡にいた時にかかってきた電話。\n まだまだいっぱいあるけど、全部全部、大切な思い出です。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXP4YBS5391Z1HD7HAJPDK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n #ゆみこかめら で撮った大切な一枚。\n \n カメラ持ってて良かった！\n 写真が好きで良かった！\n おかげでこんな素敵な写真が残せたよ！\n 過去の自分！ありがとう！\n っていう気持ち☺︎\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXP6N1AXKM55A3HZJQFK90","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 初めてのアーティスト写真撮影の時！\n \n \n \n \n 初めて2人で撮った写真はめちゃくちゃ光で飛んでました（笑）\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXP7YPTFPYX34C5C4TZVWT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXP91T2MWY2G331YPREQ9Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXPAX2PDBVTVY6F80E0PV9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQ1WF8ZS2T0MTVWREFMHC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQ3JBM5N57200JABCDZCH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQ63X529NRQ4VZAA6F2TS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 音楽部！\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQ784CW2E22GN0X2S1BEF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQ8W4B7D8V2T2RPB5EM8F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQAMCCK1B324AHG2Q29HZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQC1HEADK36GXN6HC37YD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQD9PCMX68S4ANKH21QVT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQEEKYYN3QKGYCTGDCSD8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXQG2XFTXW2NDHZHAC9RV3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 二期生から誰かが、卒業してしまう事が今でも信じられないくらい実感がないんですけど、この8人と一緒に欅坂46に加入できて幸せでした。\n \n きっと誰か1人でも欠けていてはだめだったと思います。\n \n まだまだ残された時間を私も大切に過ごしていくので皆さんも大切にしてくださいね。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n じゃあ、今日はここまでです！\n \n \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました！\n \n \n 関有美子🐱             "}],"source":"archive"}